Package: screenson
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, ddcutil
Description: Reset monitor brightness to 100% over DDC/CI
 screenson uses ddcutil to reset the hardware brightness of displays 1 to 3
 to 100%. It must be run as root.
